[REQUIREMENT]
UID: STD009
TITLE: The guard refuses an unsafe clearance
STATEMENT: >>>
The test shall submit a line-up for a second aircraft while the first occupies the runway and expect a refusal with the state unchanged. It shall then go around or complete the takeoff and expect the second line-up to be accepted. Acceptance is the refusal with an unchanged log prefix and the later acceptance.
<<<
RATIONALE: >>>
The guard requirement is checked here by example, and by TLC and PropEr under the other descriptions.
<<<
DAL: A
REQUIREMENT_LEVEL: Low-Level
VERIFICATION: Test
ASSUMPTIONS: The checked envelope is 4 runways, 8 aircraft under control, and 2 neighbor airports. Visual separation, LAHSO, radar vectoring, TRACON, enroute control, and wake RECAT are outside this increment.
